.TH AVR\-SKILL\-UPDATE 1 "" "avr 0.2.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-skill-update \- Update an installed Avrea skill from this avr release.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr skill update
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update an installed Avrea skill from this avr release.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr skill update
    avr skill update --target claude
    avr skill update --target all --force
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-target\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Installed agent host to update. (choices: codex, claude, all; default: all)
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace a locally modified skill.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-skill (1),
.BR avr-skill-install (1),
.BR avr-skill-status (1),
.BR avr-skill-uninstall (1)
